"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 9.284,
"text": "Our tiny GPT learns from one pile of text: Northbridge's own documents."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 9.644,
"end": 16.621,
"text": "122,069 characters, dated 3 August to 23 October."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 17.371,
"end": 18.985,
"text": "Three kinds of text."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 19.391,
"end": 28.377,
"text": "Most is generated from Northbridge's seed data: notes, stores entries and orders, with stock figures drawn at random, on purpose."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 28.737,
"end": 30.711,
"text": "Then e-mails between the staff."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 31.187,
"end": 33.706,
"text": "Then every line of its purchase policies."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 33.927,
"end": 35.622,
"text": "All shuffled together."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 36.372,
"end": 40.703,
"text": "Then, cut a random window of 128 characters."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 41.004,
"end": 44.58,
"text": "The target is the same window, shifted by one."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 45.045,
"end": 49.352,
"text": "So every character is a test: guess the next one."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 49.758,
"end": 52.951,
"text": "A batch takes 32 windows."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 53.701,
"end": 54.862,
"text": "One training step."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 55.338,
"end": 60.133,
"text": "At every position, the model gives a probability to each of its 81 characters."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 60.493,
"end": 65.102,
"text": "Here it has read 4,600 on, and must guess h."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 65.462,
"end": 69.351,
"text": "Untrained, it gives h 1.6 percent."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 70.101,
"end": 75.86,
"text": "The loss measures the miss: minus the log of the probability of the right character."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 76.266,
"end": 78.263,
"text": "Here, 4.11."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 78.82,
"end": 82.593,
"text": "Guessing evenly would score 4.39."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 83.343,
"end": 91.145,
"text": "The gradient says which way to move each of the 830,464 weights, so the right characters get more probability."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 91.795,
"end": 98.808,
"text": "Every weight takes a small step that way, at a learning rate of at most 0.002."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 99.558,
"end": 104.132,
"text": "Repeat that 1,500 times, with a fresh batch each time."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 104.69,
"end": 109.217,
"text": "The loss falls from 4.59 to 0.23."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 109.624,
"end": 113.896,
"text": "The h now gets more than 99.99 percent."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 114.453,
"end": 116.961,
"text": "Before training, the model wrote noise."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 117.321,
"end": 119.573,
"text": "After, it writes Northbridge."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 120.323,
"end": 123.667,
"text": "Ask it for BAT-500 in Manchester stores."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 124.073,
"end": 129.425,
"text": "Ten tries, ten perfect stock lines: 2,400 on hand."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 129.727,
"end": 131.364,
"text": "2,800."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 131.724,
"end": 133.21,
"text": "2,100."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 133.512,
"end": 134.72,
"text": "All invented."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 135.196,
"end": 139.851,
"text": "The real 5,400 was in its text three times."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 140.211,
"end": 142.986,
"text": "It learnt the pattern, not the number."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 143.736,
"end": 155.694,
"text": "Qwen learnt the same way, at vast scale: the same game on up to 18 trillion tokens, then instruction tuning on over a million examples, then preference learning."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 156.344,
"end": 161.685,
"text": "Its weights froze at release, on 19 September 2024."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 162.092,
"end": 166.353,
"text": "Emma asked on 26 October 2026."
}
]
}